# 21. CSI raw format

Store one compressed CSV per receiver.

Use streaming Zstandard compression so long recordings do not need to remain in RAM.

Example conceptual columns:

```text
host_timestamp_ns
wall_timestamp_utc
receiver_id
port
tx_seq
mac
rssi
rate
sig_mode
mcs
bandwidth
smoothing
not_sounding
aggregation
stbc
fec_coding
sgi
noise_floor
ampdu_cnt
channel
secondary_channel
esp_local_timestamp
ant
sig_len
rx_state
len
first_word
data
```

Preserve original Espressif values whenever possible.

The raw `data` CSI array should be preserved exactly as emitted by ESP32.

Do not permanently convert the raw recording to amplitude.

