```text
/csi/iq
/csi/timestamp_ns
/csi/tx_seq
/csi/rssi
/csi/valid
/csi/missing_mask
/csi/subcarrier_index
```

For one receiver, conceptually:

```text
[P, S, 2]
```

where:

```text
P = packets
S = retained subcarriers
