# 37. Missing CSI packets

Missing packets are expected.

Do NOT silently duplicate neighboring packets.

Record missing information using a mask.

The preprocessing configuration should support strategies such as:

```text
mask only
linear interpolation
nearest interpolation
drop window
```

Default to conservative behavior.

Keep:

```text
missing_mask
```

even if interpolation is performed.

---

# 38. Keep I/Q as canonical processed data

Canonical representation:

```text
I
Q
```

From I/Q derive experimentally:

```python
amplitude = sqrt(I**2 + Q**2)
phase = atan2(Q, I)
```

Model configurations should allow choosing features such as:

```text
iq
amplitude
phase
amplitude+phase
temporal difference
normalized amplitude
```

Do not throw away I/Q simply because an initial model uses amplitude.

