# 41. ML dataset format

The generated training dataset should use HDF5.

For multi-receiver CSI, the target conceptual tensor is:

```text
X.shape = [N, T, R, S, C]
```

where:

```text
N = samples/windows
T = time steps
R = receivers
S = subcarriers
C = channels/features
```

For raw I/Q:

```text
C = 2
```

Example:

```text
[10000, 200, 3, 56, 2]
```

This is only an example.

Do NOT hard-code 56 subcarriers.

