# 44. Prevent ML data leakage

THIS IS IMPORTANT.

Never randomly split overlapping CSI windows from the same session into train/test sets.

Bad:

```text
session_001 window_001 → train
session_001 window_002 → test
session_001 window_003 → train
```

Adjacent windows are highly correlated.

Default split unit:

```text
session
```

Support:

```text
session split
subject split
room split
layout split
```

For example:

```text
train:
session_001
session_002
session_003

validation:
session_004

test:
session_005
```

Also eventually support leave-one-subject-out evaluation.

