# 85. Final expectation

This project is not just a model training notebook.

It should become a reusable **WiFi CSI HAR experimental platform** where a researcher can:

```text
configure ESP32 hardware
flash firmware
identify boards
test CSI
test cameras
record synchronized experiments
inspect data quality
automatically label video
manually correct labels
generate CSI datasets
train HAR models
evaluate models
export datasets/checkpoints
eventually perform realtime HAR
```

All core operations should be Dockerized and accessible through a coherent web interface, while model-development code remains independently usable from CLI/notebooks for research experimentation.

Build the infrastructure carefully enough that future experiments can change:

```text
